&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; line-height: 16px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;①連結EBITDA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 160px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; line-height: 16px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;当期実績÷前期実績×60％&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="3" style="vertical-align: middle; width: 347.33333333333333333333333333px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 0px none ; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; line-height: 16px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;役位別の年間基本報酬×業績評価係数(①連結EBITDA＋②連結純利益＋③連結ROE)＝業績連動報酬(賞与)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 18.67px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 88px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; line-height: 16px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;②連結純利益&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 160px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; line-height: 16px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;当期実績÷前期実績×20％&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 18.67px"&gt;
